blocks.en:
In this paper, we introduce Wizard , the first agentic game world model to enable fine-grained control of characters and scenes through articulated skeletons and geometry maps, respectively, while maintaining mechanics-consistent, real-time interaction. Trained on our constructed diverse dataset 1 1 1 WildWorld is used under its non-commercial research license;
no WildWorld-derived data is redistributed.
Elden Ring footage was recorded by the authors and is used solely for research. , Wizard demonstrates strong zero-shot generalization to unseen characters, scenes, and motions, enabling players to create and manipulate customized game worlds.

